    "How long a single authentication is remembered. Within this window, reconnecting won't ask again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Wie lange eine einzelne Authentifizierung gemerkt wird. Innerhalb dieses Zeitfensters wird beim erneuten Verbinden nicht noch einmal gefragt."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How long a single authentication is remembered. Within this window, reconnecting won't ask again."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hvor lenge én enkelt autentisering huskes. Innenfor dette tidsvinduet blir du ikke spurt igjen når du kobler til på nytt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud sync" : {
      "comment" : "A description of how connections sync between devices.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "iCloud-Synchronisierung"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud sync"
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud-synkronisering"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If your key is encrypted, you'll be prompted for the passphrase each time you connect. **Passphrases are never saved** — they live only in memory during a connect." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Ist der Schlüssel verschlüsselt, wird die Passphrase bei jedem Verbindungsaufbau abgefragt. **Passphrasen werden nie gespeichert** — sie befinden sich nur während des Verbindens im Arbeitsspeicher."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If your key is encrypted, you'll be prompted for the passphrase each time you connect. **Passphrases are never saved** — they live only in memory during a connect."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
