        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, using a saved password or private key requires a single Touch ID / login-password prompt per session — connecting, editing, and exporting are all covered by the same authentication for the duration of the grace window below. Your secrets stay on this Mac and never leave the Keychain." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Wenn dies aktiviert ist, erfordert die Verwendung eines gespeicherten Passworts oder privaten Schlüssels nur eine einzige Abfrage von Touch ID / Anmeldepasswort pro Sitzung — Verbinden, Bearbeiten und Exportieren sind für die Dauer des unten festgelegten Zeitfensters durch dieselbe Authentifizierung abgedeckt. Deine vertraulichen Daten bleiben auf diesem Mac und verlassen den Schlüsselbund nie."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When enabled, using a saved password or private key requires a single Touch ID / login-password prompt per session — connecting, editing, and exporting are all covered by the same authentication for the duration of the grace window below. Your secrets stay on this Mac and never leave the Keychain."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Når dette er slått på, krever bruk av et lagret passord eller en privatnøkkel bare én forespørsel om Touch ID / påloggingspassord per økt — tilkobling, redigering og eksport dekkes alle av samme autentisering så lenge tidsvinduet nedenfor varer. Hemmelighetene forblir på denne Macen og forlater aldri nøkkelringen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, your connection **names** become searchable from system-wide Spotlight so you can jump straight to a connection. Only the name is indexed — never the hostname, username, port, or any credential." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Wenn dies aktiviert ist, werden die **Namen** deiner Verbindungen systemweit über Spotlight durchsuchbar, sodass du direkt zu einer Verbindung springen kannst. Nur der Name wird indiziert — niemals Hostname, Benutzername, Port oder irgendwelche Anmeldedaten."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When enabled, your connection **names** become searchable from system-wide Spotlight so you can jump straight to a connection. Only the name is indexed — never the hostname, username, port, or any credential."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Når dette er slått på, blir **navnene** på tilkoblingene søkbare fra Spotlight i hele systemet, slik at du kan gå rett til en tilkobling. Bare navnet indekseres — aldri vertsnavnet, brukernavnet, porten eller påloggingsinformasjon av noe slag."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You choose a passphrase. The app derives a key with **PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256 (600,000 iterations)** over a fresh 16-byte salt, then encrypts the payload with **AES-256-GCM**." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Du wählst eine Passphrase. Die App leitet daraus mit **PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256 (600.000 Iterationen)** über einem frischen Salt von 16 Byte einen Schlüssel ab und verschlüsselt die Nutzdaten anschließend mit **AES-256-GCM**."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You choose a passphrase. The app derives a key with **PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256 (600,000 iterations)** over a fresh 16-byte salt, then encrypts the payload with **AES-256-GCM**."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du velger en passfrase. Appen utleder en nøkkel med **PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256 (600 000 iterasjoner)** over et nytt 16-byte-salt og krypterer deretter nyttelasten med **AES-256-GCM**."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your encrypted key contains an RSA private key. RSA is not supported and cannot be converted to another algorithm. You need to generate a new Ed25519 or ECDSA key pair." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Der verschlüsselte Schlüssel enthält einen privaten RSA-Schlüssel. RSA wird nicht unterstützt und kann nicht in einen anderen Algorithmus konvertiert werden. Es muss ein neues Ed25519- oder ECDSA-Schlüsselpaar generiert werden."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your encrypted key contains an RSA private key. RSA is not supported and cannot be converted to another algorithm. You need to generate a new Ed25519 or ECDSA key pair."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Den krypterte nøkkelen inneholder en RSA-privatnøkkel. RSA er ikke støttet og kan ikke konverteres til en annen algoritme. Du må generere et nytt Ed25519- eller ECDSA-nøkkelpar."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version" : "1.3"
}